Conflict check (CON-COI-05)

Issuer: Nivy Advisory s. r. o. · IČO 52 109 338 · Mlynské nivy 16, 821 09 Bratislava

Run the firm conflict check before a proposal is submitted, not after it is shortlisted.
The Slovak market is small, so a competitor overlap is common: work for a client's direct competitor in the same workstream needs an information barrier with separate teams, separate storage and a named barrier owner — or the proposal is declined.
A personal relationship with a client decision-maker is disclosed in writing to the engagement partner before the pitch.
Where the client is a public sector body, check the Register of Public Sector Partners and confirm the firm has no conflict with the procurement it is advising on.
An advisor who moved from the client to the firm within the last 12 months does not work on that client's matters without a documented waiver.
A conflict discovered mid-engagement is escalated the same day; it is never resolved by the engagement team alone.

